*.xlsx
*.png
**/documentation/*
*.md
__pycache__/
.vscode/*
/PREVIOUS_STALE**
*.lic
# Local run output and reference logs — never committed.
**/_scratch/
**/_baseline/
*.rData
*scratch/*    
*.trig
*.rdfox

# ── Exceptions to the blanket *.csv rule above ───────────────────────────
#
# The blanket rule keeps real clinical data out of the repository and stays.
# These two datasets are hand-fabricated (synthetic patient ids, invented
# timestamps — see each directory's README), contain no patient data, and
# are REQUIRED INPUTS, not outputs:
#
# CQ_evaluation/events_data.csv is read by CODE/evaluation_cq/
# cq_temporal_QA.py, which the rebuild-docs workflow runs on every push.
# Without it that job fails with FileNotFoundError before it can regenerate
# docs/cq — and the workflow even lists this path as one of its own triggers,
# which could never fire while the file was invisible to git.
!DATA/CQ_evaluation/events_data.csv
!DATA/CAT_evaluation/events_data.csv
# The MDA-POC-RDFox README is documentation, not output; the blanket *.md
# rule above would otherwise keep it out of the repository.
!MDA-POC-RDFox/README.md
*_scratch*
*.DS_Store
*.docx
*.pdf
